{
  "id": "vue-article-detail-001",
  "type": "vue-project",
  "category": "blog",
  "style": ["minimal", "clean"],
  "tech": ["vue3", "composition-api", "element-plus"],
  "title": "Vue3 文章详情页(正文 + 作者信息 + 评论区 + 相关推荐)",
  "embedText": "Vue3 文章详情 blog 博客 文章页 正文 阅读 作者信息 发布时间 阅读量 点赞 评论列表 评论框 相关推荐 内容详情 分享",
  "description": "博客/资讯类文章详情页,顶部大标题+封面图+作者信息,中间长文排版,侧边点赞/收藏/分享,底部评论列表与发布框,末尾相关推荐",
  "files": [{"path": "src/views/ArticleDetail.vue", "content": "<template>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <article class=\"art\">\n      <h1>{{ article.title }}</h1>\n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <el-avatar :size=\"36\" :src=\"article.author.avatar\" />\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"a-name\">{{ article.author.name }}</div>\n          <div class=\"a-info\">{{ article.date }} · 阅读 {{ article.views }} · {{ article.readTime }} 分钟阅读</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"actions\">\n          <el-button :icon=\"Star\" circle @click=\"fav = !fav\" :type=\"fav ? 'warning' : ''\" />\n          <el-button :icon=\"Share\" circle />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <img class=\"cover\" :src=\"article.cover\" alt=\"\">\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <p v-for=\"(para, i) in article.content\" :key=\"i\">{{ para }}</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"react\">\n        <el-button :type=\"liked ? 'primary' : ''\" @click=\"toggleLike\">\n          👍 {{ liked ? '已点赞' : '点赞' }} ({{ likes }})\n        </el-button>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <section class=\"comments\">\n      <h3>{{ comments.length }} 条评论</h3>\n      <div class=\"write\">\n        <el-input v-model=\"draft\" type=\"textarea\" :rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"写下你的评论...\" />\n        <el-button type=\"primary\" class=\"pub\" @click=\"publish\">发布</el-button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"list\">\n        <div class=\"cmt\" v-for=\"c in comments\" :key=\"c.id\">\n          <el-avatar :size=\"40\" :src=\"c.avatar\" />\n          <div class=\"c-body\">\n            <div class=\"c-top\"><span class=\"c-name\">{{ c.name }}</span><span class=\"c-time\">{{ c.time }}</span></div>\n            <p>{{ c.text }}</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"related\">\n      <h3>相关推荐</h3>\n      <div class=\"r-grid\">\n        <a v-for=\"r in related\" :key=\"r.id\" class=\"r-card\">\n          <img :src=\"r.img\" alt=\"\">\n          <div>{{ r.title }}</div>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script setup>\nimport { ref } from 'vue'\nimport { ElMessage } from 'element-plus'\nconst article = ref({\n  title: 'Vue3 组合式 API 完全实战指南:从入门到精通',\n  author: { name: '张伟', avatar: 'https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=1' },\n  date: '2026-04-18',\n  views: 12458,\n  readTime: 8,\n  cover: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/art/1200/500',\n  content: [\n    'Vue 3 推出组合式 API 已经超过三年,逐渐成为大型项目的首选。相比 Options API,它在逻辑复用、类型推导、代码组织三个维度都有质的提升。',\n    '本文将从一个真实的业务场景切入:一个包含用户认证、数据列表、过滤、分页的管理页面,展示如何用 Composition API 把关注点拆分成可复用的 composable。',\n    '首先定义 useAuth 处理登录态,useList 处理数据加载,useFilter 处理过滤,useDebounce 处理输入防抖。最后在组件里用几行代码组合起来,可读性远超 Options API。',\n    '在 TypeScript 加持下,ref / reactive / computed 的类型推导非常智能,IDE 几乎能百分百感知到属性类型,让重构变得安全。',\n    '总结:Composition API 不是银弹,简单组件用 Options API 反而更直观;但只要涉及逻辑复用和复杂状态管理,Composition API 的优势立刻显现。'\n  ]\n})\nconst liked = ref(false)\nconst likes = ref(328)\nconst fav = ref(false)\nconst Star = 'Star'\nconst Share = 'Share'\nfunction toggleLike() { liked.value = !liked.value; likes.value += liked.value ? 1 : -1 }\nconst draft = ref('')\nconst comments = ref([\n  { id: 1, name: '李娜', avatar: 'https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=5', time: '2 小时前', text: '写得很清晰,特别是 composable 拆分那段,受益匪浅' },\n  { id: 2, name: '王强', avatar: 'https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=8', time: '4 小时前', text: '补充一点:useDebounce 可以用第三方 vueuse,不用自己写' }\n])\nfunction publish() {\n  if (!draft.value.trim()) return ElMessage.warning('请输入内容')\n  comments.value.unshift({ id: Date.now(), name: '当前用户', avatar: 'https://i.pravatar.cc/80?img=15', time: '刚刚', text: draft.value })\n  draft.value = ''\n  ElMessage.success('评论成功')\n}\nconst related = ref([\n  { id: 1, title: 'Pinia 替代 Vuex 实战', img: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/r1/300/180' },\n  { id: 2, title: 'Vite 构建优化 10 条', img: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/r2/300/180' },\n  { id: 3, title: 'Vue 性能调优清单', img: 'https://picsum.photos/seed/r3/300/180' }\n])\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n.page { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px; background: #fff; }\n.art h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.3; }\n.meta { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.a-name { font-weight: 500; color: #0f172a; }\n.a-info { font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px; }\n.actions { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; }\n.cover { width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; aspect-ratio: 12/5; object-fit: cover; }\n.content p { color: #334155; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 16px; }\n.react { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; margin-top: 24px; }\n.comments { margin-top: 36px; }\n.comments h3 { color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.write { position: relative; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.pub { position: absolute; bottom: 12px; right: 12px; }\n.cmt { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }\n.c-body { flex: 1; }\n.c-top { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.c-name { font-weight: 500; color: #0f172a; }\n.c-time { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; }\n.c-body p { color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; }\n.related { margin-top: 40px; }\n.related h3 { color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.r-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n.r-card { background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: #0f172a; transition: transform .2s; cursor: pointer; }\n.r-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }\n.r-card img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 5/3; object-fit: cover; }\n.r-card div { padding: 12px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }\n</style>"}],
  "qualityScore": 0.93
}
